title: The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> breaks toleration!
subtitle: The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> is with our policies...
new-page: true
view-if: dvp_in_government and spd_toleration and spd_patience < 0 and dvp_r < 50 and not constructive_vonc
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 5; new_middle_dvp -= 6; old_middle_dvp -= 4; labor_dissent += 5; liberal_dissent += 6; industrialist_strength += 4; nationalist_strength += 6;
tags: event
go-to: vonc_menu

# Options: spend relations to reduce coalition_dissent

= Vote of No Confidence

Despite the current precarious situation of German politics, our neglect of workers' needs has compelled the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> parliamentary delegation to call for a vote of no confidence against our government, even if they likely stand to lose in the upcoming election.

- @spd_breaks_toleration: Our government falls.

@spd_breaks_toleration
call: set_next_election_time
on-arrival: time_to_election = 3; spd_toleration = 0; chancellor = "Brüning"; chancellor_party = "Z"; foreign_minister_party = dvp_name; finance_minister_party = dvp_name; interior_minister_party = "Z"; justice_minister_party = "I"; labor_minister_party = "Z"; reichswehr_minister_party = "I"; economic_minister_party = dvp_name; finance_minister_party = "DVP"; agriculture_minister_party = "Z"; labor_minister = "Stegerwald"; interior_minister = "Wirth"; finance_minister = "Moldenhauer"; economic_minister = "Curtius"; justice_minister = "Koch-Weser"; foreign_minister = "Stresemann"; agriculture_minister = "Dietrich"; reichswehr_minister = "Groener"; coalition_dissent = 0; pro_republic -= 5; workers_nsdap += 3 if pro_republic < 40; old_middle_nsdap += 4 if pro_republic < 50; new_middle_nsdap += 3 if pro_republic < 50
go-to: interim_bruning

The vote succeeds, Though Chancellor Brüning continues as the head of an acting government.

